OL,3,GNEWSA'You've had a wonderful life
OL,4,ATommy, but it's over' - Sir Tom feared
OL,5,Ahe was dying
OL,6,
OL,7,F"[I thought] Oh well, this is it,
OL,8,Fyou've had a wonderful life, Tommy, but
OL,9,Fit's over right now," he said.
